[node name="Brief" type="Label" parent="Center/Panel/Content"]
layout_mode = 2
text = "Test loop: leave 01 Base, follow the upper passage through 02 Cave to 03 Twin Spires, then return west below the rock shelf.
Move: WASD / arrows or left stick / D-pad (default bindings).
Active sonar: F / controller X (defaults), temporary echo markers.\nMap: M / Back-Select (defaults); permanent sonar discoveries.\nScience: E / controller A (Interact defaults); discover, approach, scan.\nMap → Research log shows completed records.\nOptional: overlook and marked pressure trench. Sonar not required.
No station services, missions or scanning. Restart resets vessel/route; permanent discoveries are preserved."
